description:
Automated mechanisms exist to enforce replay-resistant Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) through authenticators whose outputs cannot be reused, using:
(1) Nonces;
(2) One-time challenges;
(3) Time-synchronous values; and/or
(4) Channel binding.

